        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "430a5316-0662-49ec-ab96-0fe31a21a5e4",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "507ae2e6-2cb9-4452-a892-914fdbebe750",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "b098edeb-c6f6-4a92-aeaa-d3f24552345e",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "The valve account\nshows twenty Coins\nfor inspection,\nalready paid by\nSlush, and six for",
                      "storage, still\ndisputed. The city\nclaim slip keeps\nownership public.\nThe foreman",
                      "remembers Slush\npaying promptly\nwhen the pipe was\nmoved; he also\nremembers nobody",
                      "agreeing to\nprivate ownership.\nPip suggests\nthanking him for\nthe actual payment",
                      "without accepting\nthe extra claim.\nThe foreman hands\nyou a clean tally\ncard."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "d5ed5ac1-6e85-455e-a3f0-378e499a843a",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
